{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "7366b717a85e628101c0cb13b9d70eddf693c7d942169451cf4352851160719f", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}ちゃん！\nみんなの前じゃ言いづらいことって、あるよね？", "zh": "欸欸，小{$P$}！\n有些事在大家面前很难说出口对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a67b97942924366d9c04e1f88c7bec091df19dfa8fc99c9902ad015f2e6873a9", "ja": "……？\n茜、どうしたんだ？　急に。", "zh": "……？\n茜，你是怎么啦？突然说这种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "52a88941c00cf9eff4785b6b2ecd57f356160eac1a6833e7f326f691801e2989", "ja": "いいんだよ、{$P$}ちゃん！　今なら\n誰もいないんだから、茜ちゃんをナデナデしても……！", "zh": "没事的，小{$P$}！现在其他人不在，\n就算摸摸小茜的头也没关系……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "5158a7532c95761734119ed616deadd80438e740eac9983504caf0284ab2d540", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんも、見てたでしょ？\nクレシェンドブルーでの、茜ちゃんの活躍を！", "zh": "小{$P$}你都有看到吧？\n小茜在『Crescendo Blue』中的活跃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "fd50d611ce2d6388cf45389555fa616b4f80f3961ed0501e9605c47d9b20329c", "ja": "茜ちゃんがいなかったら、ユニットはバラバラに\n空中分解していたよね！　確実に！　木端微塵に！", "zh": "如果没有小茜在，团体八成会瓦解得四分五裂吧！\n肯定会！彻底粉碎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e0df720e347432e88d589f1fe08528ba29d9f51967dc8ad207fe2e3694ddaa0", "ja": "不穏なことを言うな……。確かに茜は、\nクレシェンドブルーのムードメーカーだったけどな。", "zh": "别说这么让人不安的话好吗……\n不过茜的确是『Crescendo Blue』里的开心果啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "2f9c00ab7b601889c5b21763aaf55ab644a51d0a82fa953600c056e14aa270d7", "ja": "でしょでしょ！\nやっぱり茜ちゃんのおかげだよね！　ねっ？", "zh": "对吧对吧！\n都是托小茜的福对不对！对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f528a6db3e5af4de4b68ae8845aeed372753f5f17ae0c695e8f0eb7566e490c8", "ja": "まあ、部分的にはそうとも言えるな……。\n偉いぞ茜！　よくやった！", "zh": "哎，从某部分来看也是可以这么说……\n很了不起喔，茜！做得好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "381380d3951f865e4a2597cf8419f64f077a50a4c22dbeada8223df0d50c19e1", "ja": "まあね！　茜ちゃんくらいになるとユニットのひとつや\nふたつ、上手くいって当然だけどね～☆", "zh": "是啊！像小茜这么有实力的偶像，\n能成功凝聚一两个团体的向心力也是理所当然的～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "f6ee9fab9ce1052213cf75c1df268092ef9318735b0888609fadaeb1050a1027", "ja": "というワケで……\n今日はご褒美に、プリン食べに行こー！！", "zh": "所以说……\n为了奖励小茜，今天我们去吃布丁吧──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0c32f729ba162f0bc58de14d1da5315b3bd09c963a4413d75f82f130c65ee6dd", "ja": "それが目的だったのか……。", "zh": "原来这就是你的目的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "118c04f76196a857eeaedd38bcef7fcf3ef151c74001270f415f9eb92c6b32b1", "ja": "いいじゃんいいじゃん{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃん偶然にも、いいプリン出す店知ってるから！", "zh": "好嘛好嘛，小{$P$}！\n很偶然地，小茜刚好知道一间有卖好吃布丁的店喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d14075292e3ffd31da392ae00a883f4acaeb09cea8af18854eba6c64fcdbe3d", "ja": "大丈夫、この近くだから！\nホラホラ{$P$}ちゃん、早く早く！", "zh": "别担心，就在这附近而已！\n走吧走吧，小{$P$}，快点快点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c93cbd33396f1eb2f262c05fd31339e354ce0428a0fa10d20d8ba3cc318a8611", "ja": "（まあ、レッスンも真面目に頑張っていたし……\n今日は茜を、たくさん褒めてやることにしよう！）", "zh": "（算了，反正她也很认真参加训练课程……\n今天就多多夸奖茜吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
